The full MIT License text ships with the submodule at
src/main/native/whisper/LICENSE.

================================================================================
2. Generated bindings
================================================================================

The sources under src/main/java/jp/clip/whisper/ffm/gen are generated by
jextract from src/main/native/whisper/include/whisper.h. They therefore mirror
the declarations of whisper.cpp, which is MIT licensed (see section 1).
Regenerate them with scripts/jextract-whisper.ps1.

  jextract
    https://github.com/openjdk/jextract
    Part of the OpenJDK project

================================================================================
3. Bundled VAD model
================================================================================

The published jar includes a Voice Activity Detection model,
ggml-silero-v6.2.0.bin, obtained from:

  https://huggingface.co/ggml-org/whisper-vad

It is a ggml conversion of the Silero VAD model:

  silero-vad
    https://github.com/snakers4/silero-vad
    Copyright (c) 2020-present Silero Team
    Licensed under the MIT License

The conversion is distributed by the whisper.cpp project (ggml-org) under the
same MIT terms. The MIT License permits redistribution provided this notice is
kept.
